    excerpt: 'ThinkMarkets has 83 negative outcomes among its latest 93 WikiFX cases, a 1.74 trust score and an unconfirmed UK office address.', category: 'news', editorialType: 'Opinion', author: authors[3], publishedAt: '2026-09-05', updatedAt: '2026-09-05', featuredImage: 'https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/2026-09-05_ThinkMarkets_cover-KbNc0ziMbDbsM33ROkGXKdsekAsCVd.png', imageAltText: 'ThinkMarkets records 83 negative cases out of 93 — BestForex.io Broker Watch', readingTime: '6 min read', wordCount: 720,
    metaTitle: 'ThinkMarkets Complaints: 83 of 93 Cases Negative', metaDescription: 'ThinkMarkets has 83 negative outcomes from 93 recent WikiFX cases and a 1.74 score. Review its licenses, office findings and withdrawal complaints.', sourceName: 'WikiFX', tags: ['ThinkMarkets', 'WikiFX', 'Withdrawal Complaints', 'FCA', 'Broker Review', 'Broker Watch'], isFeatured: true, relatedBrokers: ['thinkmarkets'], linkedSources: [{ label: 'WikiFX — ThinkMarkets dealer profile and complaint record', url: 'https://www.wikifx.com/en/dealer/0001423088.html' }],
    content: `<p>ThinkMarkets has recorded 83 negative outcomes in its latest 93 documented cases on WikiFX. The monitoring platform gives the broker a trust score of 1.74 out of 10, a Risk Control score of zero and a Complaint Blacklist designation.</p><h2>What ThinkMarkets Traders Reported</h2><p>One trader said a $5,249 withdrawal requested in August 2025 remained locked three months later. Another reported depositing almost $8,000, earning $590 and then being unable to withdraw. Other allegations concern wide spreads, slippage, execution failures and account suspensions. These are user reports, not regulatory findings.</p><h2>Licenses and the Unconfirmed UK Office</h2><p>ThinkMarkets holds genuine licenses in Australia, the United Kingdom, Cyprus, New Zealand, South Africa and Seychelles. WikiFX field surveys confirmed offices in Australia and Cyprus but reported no physical presence at the address associated with the FCA-registered UK entity.</p><section aria-labelledby="bestforex-view-heading-152" class="rounded-xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 px-6 py-6 my-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-3">BestForex.io View</p><h2 id="bestforex-view-heading-152" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">Licenses do not erase the complaint record</h2><p>ThinkMarkets is not an unregulated shell. Even so, a negative outcome rate above eight in ten escalated cases and an unconfirmed UK office warrant caution.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="about-thinkmarkets-heading-152" class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-6 py-6 my-8"><h2 id="about-thinkmarkets-heading-152" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">About ThinkMarkets</h2><p>ThinkMarkets is an international forex and CFD broker operated through several regulated entities.</p></section><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Is ThinkMarkets regulated?</h3><p>Yes. Its entities hold licenses including ASIC, FCA and CySEC authorisations.</p><h3>What is ThinkMarkets&apos; WikiFX score?</h3><p>WikiFX lists a 1.74 out of 10 trust score and a Risk Control rating of zero.</p>`
