    id: 'post-151', slug: 'doo-prime-wikifx-office-review', title: 'Doo Prime Could Not Be Found at Four Listed Offices, WikiFX Surveys Say',
    excerpt: 'WikiFX field surveys reported no confirmed Doo Prime office at four listed addresses amid 35 complaints and a 2.85 trust score.', category: 'news', editorialType: 'Opinion', author: authors[6], publishedAt: '2026-09-05', updatedAt: '2026-09-05', featuredImage: 'https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/2026-09-05_DooPrime_cover-8hECvm8AboxHEOtMuf6nwPKUC70I2b.png', imageAltText: 'Doo Prime not found at four listed offices — BestForex.io Broker Watch', readingTime: '6 min read', wordCount: 760,
    metaTitle: 'Doo Prime Review: Four Offices Not Confirmed', metaDescription: 'WikiFX could not confirm Doo Prime at four listed offices. Examine its licenses, 2.85 trust score and documented withdrawal allegations.', sourceName: 'WikiFX', tags: ['Doo Prime', 'WikiFX', 'Broker Offices', 'Withdrawal Complaints', 'Broker Review', 'Broker Watch'], isFeatured: true, relatedBrokers: ['doo-prime'], linkedSources: [{ label: 'WikiFX — Doo Prime dealer profile and field surveys', url: 'https://www.wikifx.com/en/dealer/6371137692.html' }],
    content: `<p>WikiFX field surveys reported no confirmed Doo Prime presence at four addresses listed across Hong Kong, the United Kingdom, Cyprus and Malaysia. The platform currently scores the broker 2.85 out of 10 and records 35 user complaints.</p><h2>What the Complaints Allege</h2><p>Reports from several countries describe withdrawals blocked after accusations of bonus abuse or irregular trading. A separate Forex Peace Army complainant alleges $185,000 in profit was withheld over claimed market manipulation. Doo Prime has not publicly answered that allegation, and no regulator has published a finding in the case.</p><h2>Doo Prime&apos;s Regulatory Position</h2><p>The group does hold licenses, including authorisations associated with CySEC, ASIC and Vanuatu. Those genuine credentials should be distinguished from the separate question of whether listed offices could be verified.</p><section aria-labelledby="bestforex-view-heading-151" class="rounded-xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 px-6 py-6 my-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-3">BestForex.io View</p><h2 id="bestforex-view-heading-151" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">A license is only part of the risk check</h2><p>Four unconfirmed addresses, a low trust score and recurring withdrawal allegations create a risk profile traders should examine before funding an account.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="about-doo-prime-heading-151" class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-6 py-6 my-8"><h2 id="about-doo-prime-heading-151" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">About Doo Prime</h2><p>Doo Prime is a multi-asset retail trading brand within Doo Group.</p></section><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Is Doo Prime regulated?</h3><p>Affiliated entities hold licenses including CySEC, ASIC and Vanuatu authorisations.</p><h3>Why were its offices questioned?</h3><p>WikiFX surveyors reported that they could not confirm a presence at four published addresses.</p>`
